Subject: [PATCH v6 26/42] x86/resctrl: Make resctrl_arch_pseudo_lock_fn() take a plr
Date: Fri,  7 Feb 2025 18:18:07 +0000
Message-Id: <20250207181823.6378-27-james.morse@arm.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.20.1
In-Reply-To: <20250207181823.6378-1-james.morse@arm.com>
